WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,230 --> 00:00:04,830
The dignity of foreigners. How my heart fluctuates when I see you.

2
00:00:04,830 --> 00:00:07,350
Probably because I was disliked for crying.

3
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:12,160
Nothing is impossible

4
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:14,280
Your ability is as good as ours

5
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:15,640
No one is making trouble

6
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:19,460
wait a moment

7
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:30,500
Didn't you come after me and ask for my contact information?

8
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:32,500
No it's not

9
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:34,700
Do you know you have destiny?

10
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:37,100
You will see things right

11
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,460
I have a court. Do you believe this?

12
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:41,580
I'm afraid you'll think I'm mentally ill

13
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:45,470
My name is Zhou Ruoshui, what about you?

14
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:48,560
My name is Zhou Tie. Find a place to chat.

15
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:50,320
Actually, I know what you said

16
00:00:50,320 --> 00:00:51,760
My parents showed it to me before

17
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:52,800
Then why don't you have any strength?

18
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:54,320
Normally you should have left long ago

19
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:55,680
Tell me you don’t believe it

20
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:57,680
I've looked for a lot of people to look after things, but they can't help me.

21
00:00:57,680 --> 00:00:59,320
Said that the family behind me is great

22
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:01,320
Last time a master came to give me strength

23
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:02,960
I just felt it on my body

24
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:04,800
The great god just spread the valuables on the ground

25
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:06,160
Bow to me

26
00:01:06,160 --> 00:01:07,360
shouting

27
00:01:07,360 --> 00:01:09,320
Congratulations to my ancestors

28
00:01:09,320 --> 00:01:13,860
How can this be done?
